# Rust no shortcuts

Same bar as root `000-always.mdc`. Prefer Result + `?` over unwrap/expect/panic.

- NEVER weaken Clippy or re-add broad `allow(...)` to dodge lints.
- Prefer newtypes + validated constructors over bare `String` / `u64` domain IDs.
- NEVER blind-copy wire/API payloads into domain — validate at the boundary.
- Prefer injected time/RNG over hidden `SystemTime::now` / `OsRng` in library
  crates when the project uses that pattern.
- Under **strict** profile: NEVER `.unwrap()` / `.expect()` / `panic!` in tests —
  use `Result` + `?` on `#[test]` / `#[tokio::test]`.
